  "content": {
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "order": 1,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s1",
            "text": "It’s 5:30 a.m., and your phone rings."
          },
          {
            "id": "s2",
            "text": "A police officer says someone broke into 1 a store and took some expensive items."
          },
          {
            "id": "s3",
            "text": "They need you right away."
          },
          {
            "id": "s4",
            "text": "It is your job to study the whole scene for clues that will help catch the thief."
          },
          {
            "id": "s5",
            "text": "You are a crime scene investigator, and the game is on."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "order": 2,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s6",
            "text": "Outside the store, you see a broken window, but there is no glass on the street."
          },
          {
            "id": "s7",
            "text": "There are shoeprints, and marks made by a vehicle ‘s tires."
          },
          {
            "id": "s8",
            "text": "You look at the shoeprints."
          },
          {
            "id": "s9",
            "text": "They’re large, so you’re likely looking for a man."
          },
          {
            "id": "s10",
            "text": "You photograph the shoe’s pattern."
          },
          {
            "id": "s11",
            "text": "This can tell you the type of shoe."
          },
          {
            "id": "s12",
            "text": "You then measure the space between the shoeprints."
          },
          {
            "id": "s13",
            "text": "You now know how long the person’s steps were."
          },
          {
            "id": "s14",
            "text": "This gives you an idea of how tall the thief was."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "order": 3,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s15",
            "text": "As you follow the shoeprints over to the tire marks, the spaces between the steps get bigger."
          },
          {
            "id": "s16",
            "text": "They lead to the passenger’s side of the vehicle."
          },
          {
            "id": "s17",
            "text": "Now you know the thief probably didn’t work alone."
          },
          {
            "id": "s18",
            "text": "You photograph the tire marks."
          },
          {
            "id": "s19",
            "text": "They can help you find out the type of vehicle and the direction it went."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "order": 4,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s20",
            "text": "The most important clues will come from a person’s body."
          },
          {
            "id": "s21",
            "text": "You find some fingerprints near the broken window."
          },
          {
            "id": "s22",
            "text": "Using a computer, you can compare these prints against millions of others."
          },
          {
            "id": "s23",
            "text": "You also find a hair."
          },
          {
            "id": "s24",
            "text": "You keep it, because you know hair contains a person’s DNA."
          },
          {
            "id": "s25",
            "text": "You can compare this with other people’s DNA, too."
          },
          {
            "id": "s26",
            "text": "If you find a match for the fingerprint or the DNA, you will know who was in the store."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "order": 5,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s27",
            "text": "Will you find the thief?"
          },
          {
            "id": "s28",
            "text": "You now have a lot of information, so it’s possible."
          },
          {
            "id": "s29",
            "text": "For a crime scene investigator, it’s all in a day’s work."
          },
          {
            "id": "s30",
            "text": "It is usually black and made of rubber."
          },
          {
            "id": "s31",
            "text": "It’s 5:30 a.m."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
